      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kingston%2C_Tennessee",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Roane County Museum of History and Art, housed in an antebellum courthouse, showcases local artifacts.",
